  "label": "The emotional state of being a military spouse over 30 is mapped onto the man's bored expression.",
  "description": "The text 'how it feels being a military spouse over 30' is directly mapped onto the visual of the man in the yellow shirt, who is depicted with a bored and disengaged expression. This creates an analogical mapping where the man's facial expression and posture symbolize the purported emotional experience described in the text. The meme format relies on this visual-textual juxtaposition to convey the message that the man's state represents the feeling of being a military spouse over 30.",
